se: one to three paragraphs, usually 80 to 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [370, 0], "id": 8, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [9], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "on_false", "link": 5, "label": "on_false", "type": "*", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "on_true", "link": 4, "label": "on_true", "type": "*", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 78], "pos": [0, 1249.60595703125], "id": 9, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "order": 23}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [10], "